//RS /// deterministic, exactly like the existing pre-fetched-dependency flow
//RS /// (`collect_dep_dirs` only links deps already present on disk; `jet fetch` is
//RS /// the separate realize step). So a declared-but-unbuilt library is a friendly
//RS /// "run `jetpack env --prep`" (E0983), never a silent network fetch.
